{"id":"sh/wjy9sry9","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 12","position":{"left":476.16,"top":242.88,"width":327.36,"height":184.32},"text":"屋外はGNSSとSLASで位置を取得。\n近距離はBluetoothで探索する。\n\n屋内で衛星測位ができるとは想定しない。","style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
